{"seq":26,"slug":"debugging-troubleshooting","title":"调试与问题排查","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/debugging-troubleshooting","rating":{"composite":3.91,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.37,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"调试与问题排查-简介\">调试与问题排查 简介</h1><p>调试与问题排查是软件工程中最核心的实战技能之一。无论是开发阶段的逻辑错误，还是生产环境的性能瓶颈，高效的问题定位和修复能力直接决定了工程师的生产力和系统的可靠性。本知识体系从科学方法论出发，覆盖从本地调试到分布式系统排查的完整技能链。</p>\n<p>本知识体系适合有一定编程基础、希望系统性提升问题排查能力的软件工程师，尤其是需要应对复杂系统故障的后端开发者和 SRE 工程师。</p>\n<p>全书分为四章，层层递进：</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>调试方法论</strong>，建立科学调试的思维框架，掌握假设驱动调试、二分法缩小范围、构造最小复现等核心技巧，从根本上改变&quot;随机修改&quot;的低效调试习惯。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>日志与可观测性</strong>，聚焦系统运行时信息的采集与分析，包括结构化日志设计、分布式追踪的实施方案、以及基于指标与告警的主动发现机制，为问题排查提供充足的&quot;证据链&quot;。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>性能分析</strong>，深入 CPU、内存和 I/O 三大维度的 profiling 技术，掌握火焰图的生成与解读，学会系统化定位性能瓶颈并量化优化效果。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>生产环境排查</strong>，面向真实线上故障场景，建立问题分级响应机制、标准化排查 SOP 和事后分析（Postmortem）文化，确保团队在压力下依然能够高效协作、快速止损。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：先建立方法论基础（第一章），再掌握信息采集工具（第二章），然后深入性能分析技术（第三章），最后将所有技能整合到生产实战中（第四章）。每一章的知识都可以独立应用，但组合使用时将产生最大价值。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"debugging-methodology","title":"调试方法论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/debugging-troubleshooting/debugging-methodology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"scientific-debugging-process","title":"科学调试流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/debugging-troubleshooting/debugging-methodology/scientific-debugging-process"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hypothesis-driven-debugging","title":"假设驱动调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/debugging-troubleshooting/debugging-methodology/hypothesis-driven-debugging"},{"seq":3,"slug":"bisect-and-minimal-reproduction","title":"二分法与最小复现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/debugging-troubleshooting/debugging-methodology/bisect-and-minimal-reproduction"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"logging-and-observability","title":"日志与可观测性","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/debugging-troubleshooting/logging-and-observability","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"structured-logging-design","title":"结构化日志设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/debugging-troubleshooting/logging-and-observability/structured-logging-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"distributed-tracing","title":"分布式追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/debugging-troubleshooting/logging-and-observability/distributed-tracing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"metrics-and-alerting","title":"指标与告警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/debugging-troubleshooting/logging-and-observability/metrics-and-alerting"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-profiling","title":"性能分析","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/debugging-troubleshooting/performance-profiling","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cpu-memory-profiling","title":"CPU 与内存 Profiling","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/debugging-troubleshooting/performance-profiling/cpu-memory-profiling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"flame-graph-analysis","title":"火焰图解读与实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/debugging-troubleshooting/performance-profiling/flame-graph-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"bottleneck-identification","title":"瓶颈定位方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/debugging-troubleshooting/performance-profiling/bottleneck-identification"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"production-debugging","title":"生产环境排查","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/debugging-troubleshooting/production-debugging","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"incident-severity-response","title":"线上问题分级与响应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/debugging-troubleshooting/production-debugging/incident-severity-response"},{"seq":2,"slug":"troubleshooting-sop","title":"故障排查 SOP","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/debugging-troubleshooting/production-debugging/troubleshooting-sop"},{"seq":3,"slug":"postmortem-analysis","title":"事后分析 Postmortem","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/debugging-troubleshooting/production-debugging/postmortem-analysis"}]}]}